sequenceDiagram
    %% High-level editor tool flow and architectural source of truth.
    %% See sequenceDiagram.mmd for the TranslateTool-specific deep dive.
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Viewport / UI
    participant App as Application + Tool Registry
    participant Tool as Active Editor Tool
    participant Ctx as IEditorToolContext
    participant History as CommandHistory
    participant State as Undoable Editor State<br/>Selection
    participant Preview as Ephemeral Editor State<br/>Previews + Hover
    participant Doc as Document / Scene
    participant Services as SceneServices<br/>Derived Render + Picking + Gizmos

    Note over State, Preview: User-driven selection changes are undoable, <br/>previews and hover are direct, ephemeral feedback

    rect rgb(30, 30, 30)
        Note over User, Services: Input routing and tool decisions
        User->>UI: Perform an editor gesture
        UI->>App: Raise tool input phase
        App->>Tool: Dispatch to active tool with context
        Tool->>Ctx: Read document snapshots and query editor services
        Ctx-->>Tool: Read-only values, current editor state, and interaction results
        Note over Tool, Doc: The tool receives no direct document mutation capability, <br/>authoritative mutations are submitted only as commands
    end

    rect rgb(40, 40, 40)
        Note over User, Services: Transient preview during an interaction
        User->>UI: Continue gesture
        UI->>App: Raise updated tool input
        App->>Tool: Dispatch update
        Tool->>Preview: Set or update preview / hover state
        Preview-->>Services: Ephemeral state changed
        Services->>Services: Update or invalidate derived scene nodes,<br/>colliders, and gizmos
        opt Derived work is batched
            App->>Services: Flush during application update
        end
        Services-->>UI: Derived state appears on the next draw
        Note over Tool, Doc: Preview updates do not mutate the document
    end

    rect rgb(30, 30, 30)
        Note over User, Services: Complete the action
        User->>UI: Complete gesture or action
        UI->>App: Raise completion input
        App->>Tool: Dispatch completion

        alt Action changes the document
            Tool->>History: Submit command containing mutation data
            History->>Doc: Execute command against Scene
            Doc-->>Services: Document change event
            Services->>Services: Update or invalidate derived state
            History->>History: Record successful command and clear redo
        else Action changes undoable transient state
            Tool->>History: Submit editor-state command
            History->>State: Execute command, such as selection change
            State-->>Services: Undoable editor state changed
            Services->>Services: Update or invalidate affected derived state
            History->>History: Record successful command and clear redo
        else Action makes no undoable change
            Note over Tool, History: No command is submitted
        end

        opt Interaction owns ephemeral state
            Tool->>Preview: Clear owned preview / hover
            Preview-->>Services: Ephemeral state changed
            Services->>Services: Restore or re-evaluate authoritative state
        end
        opt Derived work is batched
            App->>Services: Flush during application update
        end
        Services-->>UI: Derived state appears on the next draw
        Note over App, State: Lifecycle resets may clear selection outside command history
    end

    rect rgb(40, 40, 40)
        Note over User, Services: Cancel an interaction
        UI->>App: Cancel gesture
        Note over UI, App: Escape, focus loss, navigation, or pane removal
        Note over App, Tool: Undo / redo, document replacement, disposal,<br/>and tool switching also cancel active interactions
        App->>Tool: Cancel with context
        Tool->>Preview: Clear owned preview / hover
        Preview-->>Services: Ephemeral state changed
        Services->>Services: Restore or re-evaluate authoritative state
        opt Derived work is batched
            App->>Services: Flush during application update
        end
        Services-->>UI: Derived state appears on the next draw
        Note over Tool, Doc: Cancellation submits no command and does not mutate the document
    end
